    Bug 2045031 - Fix encoding and throttling in the message send/save API. r=mkmelin


    Drop forceMsgEncoding so plain text messages use 7bit instead of base64, and
    apply the burst throttle to save operations as well, not just sends.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D304782

